WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.019
Learn to identify the error(s) in a given table or chart

00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:12.378
A table should add 5 each time: 25, 30, 36, 40. What should replace 36? The answer is

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:15.299
35. The correct third entry is 35.

00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:22.565
A learner says 33, 40, 50, 54 goes up by 7. Which listed term is incorrect? Pause and

00:00:22.565 --> 00:00:24.714
solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:25.533 --> 00:00:29.352
The answer is 50. The third step breaks the constant difference.
